      "publishedAt": "2026-10-10",
      "lastPublishedAt": "2026-10-12T01:00:00.000Z",
      "body": "这是 Halcyon 的第一篇长文。我想把写作、发布和阅读这三件事放在同一个地方，于是有了这个站点。下面记录搭建过程。\n\n再补一段普通文字，用来检查段首缩进是否只作用于正文段落。\n\n## 安装\n\n先装依赖。\n\n### 依赖\n\n```ts\nconst site: string = \"miracleHalcyon\";\nconsole.log(site);\n```\n\n| 名称 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| Astro | 框架 |\n| D1 | 数据 |\n\n- [x] 初始化项目\n- [ ] 写完文档\n\n这是 ~~删除线~~ 示例。\n\n## 配置\n\n### 环境变量\n\n> 我们这一代人，想得到的东西总是太多了。\n>\n> — 鲁迅\n\n![山](/img/2026/10/aaaaaaaaaa_1600x900_556677.jpg \"图注一\")\n\n![海](/img/2026/10/bbbbbbbbbb_1200x800_112233.jpg#wide)\n\n![网格一](/img/2026/10/cccccccccc_800x1200_445566.jpg)\n![网格二](/img/2026/10/dddddddddd_1000x1000_778899.jpg)\n![网格三](/img/2026/10/eeeeeeeeee_1400x1050_8a7b6c.jpg)\n\n![手风琴一](/img/2026/10/ffffffffff_900x1600_3d6a2c.jpg#accordion)\n![手风琴二](/img/2026/10/gggggggggg_1920x1080_a8382c.jpg)\n![手风琴三](/img/2026/10/hhhhhhhhhh_1080x1350_e8a15a.jpg)\n![手风琴四](/img/2026/10/iiiiiiiiii_2000x1000_262626.jpg)\n![手风琴五](/img/2026/10/aaaaaaaaaa_1600x900_556677.jpg)\n\n![实况](/img/2026/10/jjjjjjjjjj_960x1280_6b7f8e.jpg#live)\n\n## 结语\n\n![缺失的图](/img/2026/10/zzzzzzzzzz_800x600_808080.jpg)\n",
      "cover": "/img/2026/10/aaaaaaaaaa_1600x900_556677.jpg"
